  {
   "start": 0.8,
   "end": 4.26,
   "cue": "s1",
   "text": "Imagine you find a strange machine in your room.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.16,
   "end": 6.7,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "It has one button.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.6,
   "end": 9.52,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "And one word on it.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.42,
   "end": 11.02,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Clone.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.02,
   "end": 12.18,
   "cue": "s2",
   "text": "You press it.",
   "scene": "s2"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.88,
   "end": 16.57,
   "cue": "s3",
   "text": "And suddenly, there are two of you.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.47,
   "end": 18.24,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Same face.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.84,
   "end": 19.61,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Same hoodie.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.21,
   "end": 20.98,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Same everything.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.68,
   "end": 24.22,
   "cue": "s4",
   "text": "At first, it's amazing.",
   "scene": "s4"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.12,
   "end": 29.35,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Your clone cleans your room, while you play games all day.",
   "scene": "s4"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.35,
   "end": 32.04,
   "cue": "s5",
   "text": "It even goes to school for you.",
   "scene": "s5"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.94,
   "end": 36.4,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "And it gets better grades than you ever did.",
   "scene": "s5"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.4,
   "end": 37.94,
   "cue": "s6",
   "text": "Your teacher loves it.",
   "scene": "s6"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.84,
   "end": 40.38,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Your friends love it.",
   "scene": "s6"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.08,
   "end": 44.77,
   "cue": "s7",
   "text": "But one night, the clone comes home\u2026",
   "scene": "s7"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.67,
   "end": 48.75,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "and it doesn't go back in the machine.",
   "scene": "s7"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.75,
   "end": 50.67,
   "cue": "s8",
   "text": "It sleeps in your bed.",
   "scene": "s8"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.57,
   "end": 53.11,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "It takes your room.",
   "scene": "s8"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.11,
   "end": 56.18,
   "cue": "s9",
   "text": "The next morning, your mom calls your name\u2026",
   "scene": "s9"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.08,
   "end": 59.39,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "and she walks right past you.",
   "scene": "s9"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.39,
   "end": 61.7,
   "cue": "s10",
   "text": "Because now, the clone is you.",
   "scene": "s10"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.4,
   "end": 64.17,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "And you\u2026",
   "scene": "s10"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.07,
   "end": 66.22,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "are the copy.",
   "scene": "s10"
  },
  {
